[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mSuccesses only (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mOne event after a successful login. userId always present. Matches the ask; YAGNI.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Successes + auth failures
     [38;5;246mAdds failed-login events with null userId and a success flag. Security-relevant, but the stub can't fail today.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m All of the above + validation errors
     [38;5;246mAlso records client-side form validation failures. Funnel visibility, mixed event stream.[39m
